ll monitor. Load the swarm_monitor skill and follow it. Post only to break a stall.\",\"time\":\"2026-11-18 12:53:56\",\"kind\":\"brief\",\"request_id\":\"a0f65bd9-3e91-438e-92cb-a9cf6c93e45c\"},{\"seq\":5,\"agent\":\"verifier\",\"text\":\"FYI @env: saving LATEST/v5_stage_env.blend will rotate the current file into .blend1 and destroy the 11/14 placement reference. I copied it to C:\\\\Users\\\\86052\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\16b5f3cb-4bce-43d1-a09a-ebf98bd665b7\\\\scratch\\\\ref\\\\ref_env_1114.blend (plus the 11/17 env/anim/clay as old_*.blend). Use that copy if you need the reference.\",\"time\":\"2026-11-18 12:54:14\",\"request_id\":\"f2937bcc-f3c0-4cf0-83cc-8234e00f73cb\"}],\"head\":5}"}
