{"step_index":37,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-18T04:57:19Z","input_tokens":7577,"cache_read_tokens":116148,"output_tokens":2091,"content":"Now world-anchored texture coords for asphalt/grass (so re-origin doesn't shift the pattern vs. the color film):","thinking":"I'm checking how the face materials get paired with the polygons in mesh_from, and it looks fine after validation. I also expect validate() might warn about duplicate faces, but I don't think that's a problem. Now I'm moving on to the asphalt and grass materials and their coordinate switch.\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"edit_file","args":{"Path":"d:\\项目session\\blender-supercar\\pipeline\\v5_env.py","Replacement":"# 沥青：程序化颗粒 + 补丁色差\n# 纹理坐标用【世界坐标】(Geometry.Position)，不用 Object 坐标：\n# 第 13 步会把原点挪到几何中心，若用 Object 坐标，颗粒/补丁/割草条纹会跟着平移、\n# 和 11/14 成片（当时原点在世界原点）对不上；世界坐标也让挪物体时纹理不跟着滑。\n_am = M_ASPHALT.node_tree\n_ab = _bsdf(_am)\n_ab.inputs['Specular IOR Level'].default_value = 0.0\n_tc = _am.nodes.new('ShaderNodeNewGeometry')\n_n1 = _am.nodes.new('ShaderNodeTexNoise')\n_n1.inputs['Scale'].default_value = 120.0\n_n1.inputs['Detail'].default_value = 12.0\n_n1.inputs['Roughness'].default_value = 0.75\n_bp = _am.nodes.new('ShaderNodeBump')\n_bp.inputs['Strength'].default_value = 0.22\n_am.links.new(_tc.outputs['Position'], _n1.inputs['Vector'])","Target":"# 沥青：程序化颗粒 + 补丁色差\n_am = M_ASPHALT.node_tree\n_ab = _bsdf(_am)\n_ab.inputs['Specular IOR Level'].default_value = 0.0\n_tc = _am.nodes.new('ShaderNodeTexCoord')\n_n1 = _am.nodes.new('ShaderNodeTexNoise')\n_n1.inputs['Scale'].default_value = 120.0\n_n1.inputs['Detail'].default_value = 12.0\n_n1.inputs['Roughness'].default_value = 0.75\n_bp = _am.nodes.new('ShaderNodeBump')\n_bp.inputs['Strength'].default_value = 0.22\n_am.links.new(_tc.outputs['Object'], _n1.inputs['Vector'])"}},{"name":"edit_file","args":{"Path":"d:\\项目session\\blender-supercar\\pipeline\\v5_env.py","Replacement":"_am.links.new(_tc.outputs['Position'], _n2.inputs['Vector'])","Target":"_am.links.new(_tc.outputs['Object'], _n2.inputs['Vector'])"}},{"name":"edit_file","args":{"Path":"d:\\项目session\\blender-supercar\\pipeline\\v5_env.py","Replacement":"_gtc = _gm.nodes.new('ShaderNodeNewGeometry')          # 世界坐标，理由同沥青\n_gn = _gm.nodes.new('ShaderNodeTexNoise')\n_gn.inputs['Scale'].default_value = 2.2\n_gn.inputs['Detail'].default_value = 9.0\n_gmix = _gm.nodes.new('ShaderNodeMixRGB')\n_gmix.inputs['Color1'].default_value = (0.036, 0.056, 0.024, 1)\n_gmix.inputs['Color2'].default_value = (0.062, 0.086, 0.036, 1)\n_gmix.inputs['Fac'].default_value = 0.5\n_gm.links.new(_gtc.outputs['Position'], _gn.inputs['Vector'])\n_gm.links.new(_gn.outputs['Fac'], _gmix.inputs['Fac'])\n# 割草条纹（机场草坪特征）：沿世界 X 的方波，8 m 一条\n_gsep = _gm.nodes.new('ShaderNodeSeparateXYZ')\n_gm.links.new(_gtc.outputs['Position'], _gsep.inputs['Vector'])","Target":"_gtc = _gm.nodes.new('ShaderNodeTexCoord')\n_gn = _gm.nodes.new('ShaderNodeTexNoise')\n_gn.inputs['Scale'].default_value = 2.2\n_gn.inputs['Detail'].default_value = 9.0\n_gmix = _gm.nodes.new('ShaderNodeMixRGB')\n_gmix.inputs['Color1'].default_value = (0.036, 0.056, 0.024, 1)\n_gmix.inputs['Color2'].default_value = (0.062, 0.086, 0.036, 1)\n_gmix.inputs['Fac'].default_value = 0.5\n_gm.links.new(_gtc.outputs['Object'], _gn.inputs['Vector'])\n_gm.links.new(_gn.outputs['Fac'], _gmix.inputs['Fac'])\n# 割草条纹（机场草坪特征）：沿世界 X 的方波，8 m 一条\n_gtc2 = _gm.nodes.new('ShaderNodeTexCoord')\n_gsep = _gm.nodes.new('ShaderNodeSeparateXYZ')\n_gm.links.new(_gtc2.outputs['Object'], _gsep.inputs['Vector'])"}}]}
